        "original_id": "dda3e1af-1c38-538d-a337-b08183b62856",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alexandra Daddario, John Luessenhop, Adam Marcus, Debra Sullivan, Kirsten Elms, Stephen Susco\n- Works: Texas Chainsaw 3D, Hall Pass, White Collar, It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia, True Detective, American Horror Story\n- Topics: film roles, guest television appearances, film production credits\n\nFacts:\n- Alexandra Daddario starred in the films \"Hall Pass\" and \"Texas Chainsaw 3D.\"\n- Alexandra Daddario guest starred on the series \"White Collar,\" \"It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia,\" \"True Detective,\" and \"American Horror Story.\"\n- \"Texas Chainsaw 3D\" was promoted as \"Texas Chainsaw\" and is a 2013 American slasher film.\n- John Luessenhop directed \"Texas Chainsaw 3D.\"\n- Adam Marcus, Debra Sullivan, and Kirsten Elms wrote the screenplay for \"Texas Chainsaw 3D.\"\n- Stephen Susco, Adam Marcus, and Debra Sullivan received story credit for \"Texas Chainsaw 3D.\"",
